  "provenance_caveat": "All counts here are the SAME already-committed, already-verified raw counts from stephenson_sample_subtype_cell_counts_v1.tsv (source: the per-cohort RAW, provisional stephenson_monocyte_raw.h5ad) -- no new h5ad read was performed to build this table. The per-subtype cutoff sensitivity numbers are a DESCRIPTIVE exploration of how many donors would qualify at illustrative thresholds, NOT a new inclusion/QC rule, NOT a subtype choice, and NOT a claim that the surviving donors are ready for a real DE run.",
  "qc_source_evidence": {
    "checked_date": "2026-10-16",
    "checked_paths": [
      "/bigdata/godziklab/shared/Xinru/302006/02_EMBEDDINGS/option_c_monocyte/stephenson_monocyte_raw.h5ad",
      "/bigdata/godziklab/shared/Xinru/302006/05_RESULTS/rebuild_upfront_qc/stephenson_decontx_input/{cells.csv,genes.csv,stephenson_decontx_contamination_scores.csv} (headers/full small CSVs; counts.mtx and stephenson_decontx_counts.mtx NOT read -- 12G/25G, bounded-read only)",
      "/bigdata/godziklab/shared/Xinru/302006/05_RESULTS/rebuild_upfront_qc/gate1_qc/stephenson/qc_flags_per_cell.csv (full read, 132MB, cell-level QC flags)",
      "/bigdata/godziklab/shared/Xinru/302006/05_RESULTS/rebuild_upfront_qc/gate2_scrublet/ (ls only)",
      "scripts/31_donor_level_revision/code/build_monocyte_canonical.py (read, not executed)",
      "scripts/32_rebuild_upfront_qc/code/build_stephenson_decontx_input.py (read, not executed)",
      "scripts/32_rebuild_upfront_qc/qc_caveats.md, qc_checklist.md (read)"
    ],
    "findings": [
      "Gate 1 QC is APPLIED for Stephenson (gate1_qc/stephenson/DONE = 'gate1 applied', dated 2026-09-21) with a per-cell qc_flags_per_cell.csv carrying flag_would_delete/n_flags.",
      "DecontX is COMPLETE for Stephenson (qc_caveats.md: 'DecontX complete: mean contamination 13.0%, median 2.3%', dated 2026-09-18) with a per-cell contamination score file.",
      "cell_id join CONFIRMED 100%: stripping the 'steph_' prefix from stephenson_monocyte_raw.h5ad's obs index gives an EXACT cell_id match, with 0 mismatches, for ALL 128,503 monocyte-pilot cells against BOTH gate1_qc/stephenson/qc_flags_per_cell.csv and stephenson_decontx_input/stephenson_decontx_contamination_scores.csv (channel_id/sample_id also verified consistent for every matched cell).",
      "Gate 1 flag_would_delete rate by monocyte subtype (real, this join): C1_CD16_mono 140/3942 (3.6%), CD14_mono 349/58562 (0.6%), CD16_mono 114/13619 (0.8%), CD83_CD14_mono 425/51735 (0.8%), Mono_prolif 7/645 (1.1%).",
      "DecontX contamination by monocyte subtype (real, this join, mean): C1_CD16_mono 29.9%, CD14_mono 6.0%, CD16_mono 29.7%, CD83_CD14_mono 5.4%, Mono_prolif 9.4% -- the two coarser/less-specific subtypes (C1_CD16_mono, CD16_mono) carry notably higher ambient-RNA contamination than CD14_mono/CD83_CD14_mono.",
      "Gate 2 Scrublet for Stephenson exists only as 'gate2_scrublet/stephenson.INVALID_postqc_prior_20260921' -- explicitly marked INVALID by its own directory name, not a current, usable doublet result.",
      "'raw' in stephenson_monocyte_raw.h5ad names its PROVENANCE (layers['raw'] from the authors' own published atlas, per build_monocyte_canonical.py:187), not an absence of any QC -- the authors' own atlas may already reflect their own cell-calling/filtering; this was not independently checked."
    ],
    "gap": "No decision or artifact exists that says Gate 1 flags and/or DecontX-corrected counts ARE (or are not) the admitted input for THIS monocyte pilot -- that decision has not been made, by anyone, for this specific use. The decontaminated counts matrix's actual VALUES were not read this round (only the per-cell contamination SCORE, which is a small separate file) -- whether decontaminated counts should replace raw counts for a monocyte DE/scFM pilot, and whether Gate 1's flag_would_delete cells should be excluded, are open scientific choices, not resolved by this join existing. The broader platelet-level QC rebuild overall completion status (docs/current-status.md) is a separate, larger question this round does not re-litigate.",
    "status": "qc_admission_not_verified_for_this_pilot"
  },
